    right. right. left. exact (INB i p 264 (or_introl eq_refl) ltac:(lia)). }
  assert (DC2 : L5.defined M2 C 656) by (intros i Hi; apply GR12; [lia | apply DC; exact Hi]).
  assert (DEC2 : L5.defined M2 (sp - 384) 16) by (intros i Hi; apply GR12; [lia | apply DEC; exact Hi]).
  replace (C + 568 + 8) with (C + 576) in W1 by lia. replace (C + 568 + 16) with (C + 584) in W2 by lia.
