  destruct ISRC0 as (I0 & I16 & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & (J32 & J36 & J40 & _) & _ & _).
  replace (IS + 120 + 40) with (IS + 160) in J40 by lia.
  assert (DC : L5.defined M C 656).
  { intros i Hi. apply (DW (C + i)); [lia | | apply DC0; exact Hi].
